# Runtime output of the bridge — anchored to the app folder on purpose: on Windows git ignores case, and a bare
# "results/" also matched the source folder src/CbBridge.Core/Application/Results/.
/src/CbBridge.Web/results/
/src/CbBridge.Web/data/
/results/
/data/

